  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Chevrolet Silverado 1500 & GMC Sierra 1500 new body style\nDO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate and Carbonpro Bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: The YITAMOTOR soft tri-fold tonneau cover fit for 5.8ft bed of 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevy Silverado 1500 and GMC Sierra 1500 new body style (DO NOT FIT Multi-flex tailgate and Carbonpro Bed)\nEasy to Install & Use: No-drilling installation is a breeze with instructions and mounting hardware included; Simply fold the cover back for convenient cargo removal\nAll-around Protection: YITAMOTOR soft tri-fold tonneau cover is built using reinforced UV & cold-resistant PVC materials that aptly guard your cargo against rain, snow, and other harsh weather conditions\nUnique Clamp Design: Features two clamp types, as the rear clamp is designed with a new release bolt to effectively prevent springing with strong sealing during driving; Safety buckle connects with an aluminum safety rope that’s light and will not easily deform\nSleek Styling: With a smooth, modern profile, this tonneau cover gives your truck a clean look while protecting your cargo on every drive",
